      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Kukhnya, which means 'The Kitchen', a Russian comedy set in Claude Monet, a smart Moscow restaurant where Chef Barinov rules the kitchen. This episode opens on a quiet morning at Vika's flat. Vika is on the phone about her birthday, which is coming up, and Max is looking for his old watch. Listen to the Russian first, without worrying about every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
